     reference_answer="Per the SM6-24 manual: initial conditions — the cubicle must be de-energized, the disconnector must be open, and the earthing switch must be closed; then open the front panel to access the fuses. Change all 3 fuses when changing a fuse (IEC 282.1 §23.2) and do not re-use fuses already used. Removal: remove the top of the fuse, then support and remove it completely; when assembling, do not hold the fuse in the middle and insert the bottom all the way into the lower annular contact.",
